+      "evidence": "\"Runs when the product owner starts `initialize` after the Garura install. It reads Phoenix memory through the memory tool and builds one short set of questions about the project from what memory holds, so the choices always match what memory can give.\" \"These are the facts that decide which memory and which review rules fit.\" \"Building the project's memory from the answers and recording them in the product profile (Build the project's memory, fn-project-memory, owns it).\"",
